# Sensor Pi

Publishes simulated telemetry to the queue.

## Required environment variables

- SENSOR_PI_RABBITMQ_URL

Optional:

- SENSOR_PI_QUEUE_NAME (default: sensor_data_queue)
- SENSOR_PI_ID (default: sensor-pi-01)
- SENSOR_PI_INTERVAL_SECONDS (default: 5)

## Run locally

SENSOR_PI_RABBITMQ_URL=amqp://sensor:sensorpass@<queue-pi-ip>:5672/sensors_vhost \
python -m sensor_pi.publisher

## systemd (on Pi)

1) Copy project to /opt/sensor_pi and create /etc/sensor_pi.env
2) Install service:

sudo cp systemd/sensor-pi-publisher.service /etc/systemd/system/
sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable --now sensor-pi-publisher

## Install script

Run from the repo root:

sudo bash sensor_pi/scripts/install.sh